1
00:00:00,413 --> 00:00:03,373
(Raj:)Excuse me. I'll be right back.
Don't go anywhere. Don't move.

2
00:00:03,541 --> 00:00:07,711
(Raj:)Just stay the beautiful unspoiled
American flower that you are.

3
00:00:09,213 --> 00:00:12,633
What's wrong with you, dude?
That woman is all up on my jammy.

4
00:00:13,092 --> 00:00:17,892
(Leonard:)Okay, I hate to break this to you
and whatever your jammy is...

5
00:00:18,056 --> 00:00:20,436
...but I'm pretty sure she's a prostitute.

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,020
(Raj:)What?

7
00:00:22,727 --> 00:00:26,227
(Leonard:)- No.
- Okay, let me put it this way.

8
00:00:26,397 --> 00:00:30,027
(Leonard:)In your entire life, how many gorgeous
women have walked up to you at a bar...

9
00:00:30,193 --> 00:00:32,783
...and asked if you wanted to party?

10
00:00:35,448 --> 00:00:37,738
(Raj:)Maybe I can save her.

11
00:00:39,744 --> 00:00:44,294
Maybe. But I'm guessing it'll cost you
about $500 an hour to try.

12
00:00:48,836 --> 00:00:53,086
(Raj:)It was lovely meeting you.
Best of luck in your future endeavors.

13
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:56,390
(Leonard:)Whatever.

14
00:00:57,345 --> 00:01:01,025
(Raj:)Oh, I miss her already.

